 168:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_i2c.c **** /**
 169:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_i2c.c ****   * @brief  Initializes the I2Cx peripheral according to the specified 
 170:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_i2c.c ****   *         parameters in the I2C_InitStruct.
